00:10:32,549 --> 00:10:34,440
NEL OO TOIGGAL AYNS STRAIH DY CHAGHLAA YN

205
00:10:34,440 --> 00:10:36,000
TAPPEE TA CUR ER BUN

206
00:10:37,379 --> 00:10:40,680
VOYM NY CLUIG EUAR AYNYM MY SAILT AYNS

207
00:10:40,679 --> 00:10:43,349
FIRRINYS TA MEE TUITTYM LESH RHEAMYS SHEN HUG

208
00:10:43,350 --> 00:10:46,080
MEE CUR MOYLLEY DHYTS COMAS FREGGYRT DA'N FINISHED

209
00:10:47,759 --> 00:10:49,649
HUGGEY JIU NOB QUEIGOOYN

210
00:10:50,970 --> 00:10:53,220
SQUAAGH EH YN AGHT SHOH DY CHOSNEY ARGID

211
00:10:53,220 --> 00:10:55,860
BEA SHIRREY ER SLEIH DY CHUR FYS SHORT

212
00:10:55,860 --> 00:10:58,919
MYNYNGIONE ZERESH CUR FREGGYRT IN DOU TA LANE

213
00:10:58,919 --> 00:11:01,019
DY FALLSOONYS ER Y VEGGAN CHEEAYLLEY

214
00:11:02,070 --> 00:11:04,080
NY VEL OO SMOOINAGHT DY VEL STARTAGHYN SASSEY

215
00:11:04,080 --> 00:11:07,289
RYYANNOO SYN ART SHOH YINNAGH COSNEY DUTY ARGIDBEA

216
00:11:07,289 --> 00:11:10,529
SMOO DHYT AGH T'OU KIART HUG OO CURRYM

217
00:11:10,529 --> 00:11:13,019
ELLEY DOU AS NEEYM CUR QUEIG EARROOYN ELLEY

218
00:11:13,019 --> 00:11:15,149
DHYT GOW SOYLLEY JEH'N RAAD

219
00:11:16,470 --> 00:11:20,129
HUG EAJEE NOI VAN GUILLEY CHYNDAA MYGEAYRT VOIE

220
00:11:20,429 --> 00:11:22,500
AS EH CRAA E CHIONE AS GHOW EE

221
00:11:22,500 --> 00:11:24,150
KESMAD MAGH VEIH'N PHEAMAD

222
00:11:25,649 --> 00:11:29,159
HIRRYM VINCENT EEAR FAKIN NY BELAROOSH VA CHEET

223
00:11:29,159 --> 00:11:32,430
DY TAPPEE SHE SY RAAD DERREY VEH FO

224
00:11:32,429 --> 00:11:33,360
NY QUEEYLYN ECHEY

225
00:11:40,289 --> 00:11:43,109
AYNS UN BOGHT AS GOLL ER TOIGGAL MYR

226
00:11:43,110 --> 00:11:46,080
REN OO LURG SKEAYLLEY ER UN OIE SHEN

227
00:11:46,080 --> 00:11:49,080
RY CHLASHTYN AYNS CLAARE NY GAEL AS TA

228
00:11:49,080 --> 00:11:51,480
SHIN ER JEET GYS JERREY VUTCHOOR SHOH ABBYR

229
00:11:51,480 --> 00:11:53,730
SHEN REESHT AS MYSH OLK SHE REN OO

230
00:11:54,299 --> 00:11:55,349
SESSAL

231
00:11:59,820 --> 00:12:03,480
EDDYNYS EILEAN JULIANA AS BLEIN VIE NOA VEES

232
00:12:03,480 --> 00:12:07,680
AS BOYNYNEEASTEE VASCAGH HOSANNA AYNS UN LAA VEAGH

233
00:12:07,830 --> 00:12:12,059
AMAZING ENNAGH ELLEY LHIAMLHIAT CHENGEY FODDEEAGHT ALTERNATIVE HIE

234
00:12:12,149 --> 00:12:15,509
ER MAYRN DOILLEE EC Y GHAELG LHISAGH EEASAGHT

235
00:12:15,509 --> 00:12:21,000
HIE FEED ATCHIN AFORESAID VEIH-SHOH ISAIAH MINNID AS

236
00:12:21,000 --> 00:12:24,870
